        previous = nil,
        next = {'A Geological Survey'},
        requirements = nil,
        walkthrough = '1. Speak to any Bastokan Gate Guard and accept the Mission.\n   - Argus (NPC) - Port Bastok (L-7)\n   - Cleades - Bastok Markets (D-11)\n   - Rashid - Bastok Mines (H-10)\n   - Malduc - Metalworks (J-8)\n2. You will have to head to the Zeruhn Mines. The mines can be entered from Bastok Mines at (D-7).\n3. Speak to Makarim in Zeruhn Mines (H-11) for the [Key Item] Zeruhn report.\n4. Speak to Naji in the Metalworks top floor (J-8) for a cutscene and to complete the Mission.\n   - Lucius\' dialog in the cutscene will change depending on whether you examine the [Key Item] Zeruhn report or not.',
